#: /__w/calibre/calibre/src/pyj/book_list/fts.pyj:206
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"<div class=\"h\">Search for single words</div>\n"
"<p>Simply type the word:</p>\n"
"<div class=\"bq\">awesome<br>calibre</div>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"h\">Search for phrases</div>\n"
"<p>Enclose the phrase in quotes:</p>\n"
"<div class=\"bq\">\"early run\"<br>\"song of love\"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"h\">Boolean searches</div>\n"
"<div class=\"bq\">(calibre AND ebook) NOT gun<br>simple NOT (\"high bar\" OR hard)</div>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"h\">Phrases near each other</div>\n"
"<div class=\"bq\">NEAR(\"people\" \"in Asia\" \"try\")<br>NEAR(\"Kovid\" \"calibre\", 30)</div>\n"
"<p>Here, 30 is the most words allowed between near groups. Defaults to 10 when unspecified.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<div style=\"margin-top: 1em\"><a href=\"{fts_url}\">Complete syntax reference</a></div>"
msgstr "\n<div class=\"h\">Recherche de mots simples</div>\n<p>Simplement taper le mot:</p>\n<div class=\"bq\">superbe<br>calibre</div>\n\n<div class=\"h\">Recherche de phrases</div>\n<p>Entre guillemets :</p>\n<div class=\"bq\">\"début du parcours\"<br>\"chanson d'amour\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"h\">Recherche booléenne</div>\n<div class=\"bq\">(calibre AND livre) NOT arme<br>simple NOT (\"barre haute\" OR dur)</div>\n\n<div class=\"h\">Phrases proches les unes des autres</div>\n<div class=\"bq\">NEAR(\"peuple\" \"en Asie\" \"essayer\")<br>NEAR(\"Kovid\" \"calibre\", 30)</div>\n<p>Ici, 30 est le plus grand nombre de mots autorisés entre les groupes proches. La valeur par défaut est 10 lorsqu'elle n'est pas spécifiée.</p>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 1em\"><a href=\"{fts_url}\">Référence syntaxique complète</a></div>"

